      {
        "id": 199218,
        "name": "arenson9",
        "username": "arenson9",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arenson9/{size}/1900_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-06-19T15:48:59.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"waedens\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/w/b3f665/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> waedens:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Small world. Did you know Doug Johnson? I work more on the protein side of things, but have done a fare amount of DNA sequening as well.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Don't recognize the name. I was at the Baylor College of Medicine from 1994 to 1999 working as a programmer/analyst. Didn't meet many people at other sites and might not remember them 20 years later. Though Paul and I incidentally worked in similar fields, I didn't meet him until I started playing Sentinels. OK, technically I met him a few hours before.</p>",
